AUV Practice

This educational simulator follows Twin Delayed Deep Deterministic Policy
Gradient (TD3), introduced by Scott Fujimoto, Herke van Hoof, and David Meger
in "Addressing Function Approximation Error in Actor-Critic Methods" (2018).

Algorithmic references include https://github.com/sfujim/TD3 and OpenAI
Spinning Up's TD3 documentation. The software in this repository was written
for this project rather than copied as a fork of those implementations.

The AUV papers linked in README.md motivate the learning project. This code
does not claim to reproduce their author implementations or reported results.
